{"path":"memory/unique_ptr/operator_bool","title":"std::unique_ptr<T,Deleter>::operator bool","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::unique_ptr&lt;T,Deleter&gt;::</span>operator bool","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr/operator_bool","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Checks whether *this owns an object, i.e. whether get() != nullptr.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">explicit</span> operator <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark\">(constexpr since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks whether <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> owns an object, i.e. whether <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr/get\">get()</a></span> <code>!=</code> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">nullptr</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> owns an object, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr\"><span class=\"kw737\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unique_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> ptr<span class=\"br0\">(</span>new <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>ptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"before reset, ptr is: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>ptr <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    ptr.<span class=\"me1\">reset</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">(</span>ptr <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"after reset, ptr is: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>ptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"after reset ptr is empty\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>before reset, ptr is: 42\nafter reset ptr is empty</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr/get\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a pointer to the managed object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/unique_ptr","title":"std::unique_ptr"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::unique_ptr<T,Deleter>::operator bool","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Checks whether *this owns an object, i.e. whether get() != nullptr."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if *this owns an object, false otherwise."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"get","note":"returns a pointer to the managed object"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":104,"codeBlockCount":2}
